{"unit_id":"sixzjd__dsh-opencode-connect#card-zh","repo":"sixzjd/dsh-opencode-connect","commit":"2a50a15ce7e579f36e964d4d1a25d483a47e489c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"OpenCode（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：把 OpenCode Zen 的模型接入 DSH，注册为可选的模型提供方。插件在本机回环地址运行兼容 OpenAI Chat Completions 的服务，并把 DSH 的请求转发给 Zen。它提供可实时刷新并缓存的模型目录、模型启用与停用控制，以及在模型暂不可用时切换到目录中其他已启用模型的能力。设置卡片可以查看目录状态、搜索模型并管理凭据。适合希望在 DSH 中选择和管理 OpenCode Zen 模型的用户。可使用匿名凭据，也可以配置自己的 Zen API Key；数据和设置保存在插件数据目录中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:943-989","lib/index.js:1033-1145","client.js:187-246"]}
{"unit_id":"sixzjd__dsh-opencode-connect#card-en","repo":"sixzjd/dsh-opencode-connect","commit":"2a50a15ce7e579f36e964d4d1a25d483a47e489c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"OpenCode (a DSH Web plugin) connects Zen models. Its local OpenAI-compatible service forwards requests and refreshes the catalog. The settings card supports model search, toggles, and credential management. Requests can try another enabled model. Use anonymous access or a Zen API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:943-989","lib/index.js:1033-1145","client.js:187-246"]}
